# AEGIS OS (GUI v2): the Baloo file indexer is off by default. It scans and indexes the
# home directory in the background, which costs CPU, memory and disk writes; in a live
# session the index is lost at power-off anyway, and in a virtual machine without 3D the
# CPU is already busy drawing the desktop. Search by file name in Dolphin still works.
# Users can switch indexing on in System Settings > Search.
[Basic Settings]
Indexing-Enabled=false
